{
  "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.14",
  "key": "2.14",
  "title": "মূলদ ভগ্নাংশ (Rational Fractions)",
  "chapter": 2,
  "ordinal": 14,
  "passages": [
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.14-p001",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "একটি বহুপদিকে হর এবং একটি বহুপদিকে লব নিয়ে গঠিত ভগ্নাংশকে মূলদ ভগ্নাংশ বলা হয়। যেমন $\\frac{x}{(x - a)(x - b)}$ এবং $\\frac{a^2 + a + 1}{(a - b)(a - c)}$ মূলদ ভগ্নাংশ।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\frac{x}{(x - a)(x - b)}",
        "\\frac{a^2 + a + 1}{(a - b)(a - c)}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 58,
      "pdfPageEnd": 58,
      "printedPageStart": 53,
      "printedPageEnd": 53,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.14-p002",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ১৯.** সরল করো: $\\frac{a}{(a - b)(a - c)} + \\frac{b}{(b - c)(b - a)} + \\frac{c}{(c - a)(c - b)}$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\frac{a}{(a - b)(a - c)} + \\frac{b}{(b - c)(b - a)} + \\frac{c}{(c - a)(c - b)}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 58,
      "pdfPageEnd": 58,
      "printedPageStart": 53,
      "printedPageEnd": 53,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.14-p003",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**সমাধান:**\n$$\\frac{a}{(a - b)(a - c)} + \\frac{b}{(b - c)(b - a)} + \\frac{c}{(c - a)(c - b)}$$\n$$= -\\frac{a}{(a - b)(c - a)} - \\frac{b}{(b - c)(a - b)} - \\frac{c}{(c - a)(b - c)}$$\n$$= \\frac{a(b - c) + b(c - a) + c(a - b)}{-(a - b)(b - c)(c - a)}$$\n$$= \\frac{0}{-(a - b)(b - c)(c - a)} = 0$$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\frac{a}{(a - b)(a - c)} + \\frac{b}{(b - c)(b - a)} + \\frac{c}{(c - a)(c - b)}",
        "= -\\frac{a}{(a - b)(c - a)} - \\frac{b}{(b - c)(a - b)} - \\frac{c}{(c - a)(b - c)}",
        "= \\frac{a(b - c) + b(c - a) + c(a - b)}{-(a - b)(b - c)(c - a)}",
        "= \\frac{0}{-(a - b)(b - c)(c - a)} = 0"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 58,
      "pdfPageEnd": 58,
      "printedPageStart": 53,
      "printedPageEnd": 53,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.14-p004",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "৯ **উদাহরণ ২০.** সরল করো: $\\frac{a^2 - (b - c)^2}{(a + c)^2 - b^2} + \\frac{b^2 - (c - a)^2}{(a + b)^2 - c^2} + \\frac{c^2 - (a - b)^2}{(b + c)^2 - a^2}$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\frac{a^2 - (b - c)^2}{(a + c)^2 - b^2} + \\frac{b^2 - (c - a)^2}{(a + b)^2 - c^2} + \\frac{c^2 - (a - b)^2}{(b + c)^2 - a^2}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 58,
      "pdfPageEnd": 58,
      "printedPageStart": 53,
      "printedPageEnd": 53,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.14-p005",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**সমাধান:** প্রথম ভগ্নাংশ $= \\frac{(a + b - c)(a - b + c)}{(a + b + c)(a - b + c)} = \\frac{a + b - c}{a + b + c}$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "= \\frac{(a + b - c)(a - b + c)}{(a + b + c)(a - b + c)} = \\frac{a + b - c}{a + b + c}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 59,
      "pdfPageEnd": 59,
      "printedPageStart": 54,
      "printedPageEnd": 54,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.14-p006",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "দ্বিতীয় ভগ্নাংশ $= \\frac{(a + b - c)(b - a + c)}{(a + b + c)(a + b - c)} = \\frac{b + c - a}{a + b + c}$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "= \\frac{(a + b - c)(b - a + c)}{(a + b + c)(a + b - c)} = \\frac{b + c - a}{a + b + c}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 59,
      "pdfPageEnd": 59,
      "printedPageStart": 54,
      "printedPageEnd": 54,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.14-p007",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "তৃতীয় ভগ্নাংশ $= \\frac{(c + a - b)(c - a + b)}{(a + b + c)(b + c - a)} = \\frac{c + a - b}{a + b + c}$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "= \\frac{(c + a - b)(c - a + b)}{(a + b + c)(b + c - a)} = \\frac{c + a - b}{a + b + c}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 59,
      "pdfPageEnd": 59,
      "printedPageStart": 54,
      "printedPageEnd": 54,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.14-p008",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$\\therefore$ প্রদত্ত রাশি $\\frac{a + b - c}{a + b + c} + \\frac{b + c - a}{a + b + c} + \\frac{c + a - b}{a + b + c}$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\therefore",
        "\\frac{a + b - c}{a + b + c} + \\frac{b + c - a}{a + b + c} + \\frac{c + a - b}{a + b + c}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 59,
      "pdfPageEnd": 59,
      "printedPageStart": 54,
      "printedPageEnd": 54,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.14-p009",
      "kind": "formula",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$= \\frac{a + b - c + b + c - a + c + a - b}{a + b + c} = \\frac{a + b + c}{a + b + c} = 1$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "= \\frac{a + b - c + b + c - a + c + a - b}{a + b + c} = \\frac{a + b + c}{a + b + c} = 1"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 59,
      "pdfPageEnd": 59,
      "printedPageStart": 54,
      "printedPageEnd": 54,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.14-p010",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ২১. সরল করো:** $\\frac{(ax + 1)^2}{(x - y)(z - x)} + \\frac{(ay + 1)^2}{(x - y)(y - z)} + \\frac{(az + 1)^2}{(y - z)(z - x)}$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\frac{(ax + 1)^2}{(x - y)(z - x)} + \\frac{(ay + 1)^2}{(x - y)(y - z)} + \\frac{(az + 1)^2}{(y - z)(z - x)}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 59,
      "pdfPageEnd": 59,
      "printedPageStart": 54,
      "printedPageEnd": 54,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
