      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**সমাধান:** প্রদত্ত রাশি $\\frac{(ax + 1)^2}{(x - y)(z - x)} + \\frac{(ay + 1)^2}{(x - y)(y - z)} + \\frac{(az + 1)^2}{(y - z)(z - x)}$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\frac{(ax + 1)^2}{(x - y)(z - x)} + \\frac{(ay + 1)^2}{(x - y)(y - z)} + \\frac{(az + 1)^2}{(y - z)(z - x)}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 59,
