      "body": "$(a^2x^2 + 2ax + 1)(y - z) + (a^2y^2 + 2ay + 1)(z - x) + (a^2z^2 + 2az + 1)(x - y)$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "(a^2x^2 + 2ax + 1)(y - z) + (a^2y^2 + 2ay + 1)(z - x) + (a^2z^2 + 2az + 1)(x - y)"
