    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.14-p018",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "তদপরি, $x(y - z) + y(z - x) + z(x - y) = 0$ এবং $(y - z) + (z - x) + (x - y) = 0$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "x(y - z) + y(z - x) + z(x - y) = 0",
        "(y - z) + (z - x) + (x - y) = 0"
