      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**উদাহরণ ২২. সরল করো:** $\\frac{1}{x + a} + \\frac{2x}{x^2 + a^2} + \\frac{4x^3}{x^4 + a^4} + \\frac{8x^7}{a^8 - x^8}$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
