      "caption": null,
      "body": "$$= \\frac{2x}{x^2 + a^2} \\times \\frac{a^2 - x^2 + 2x^2}{a^2 - x^2} = \\frac{2x}{x^2 + a^2} \\times \\frac{a^2 + x^2}{a^2 - x^2} = \\frac{2x}{a^2 - x^2}$$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
